  "faithful": "The flops were formerly encumbered with many conferences altogether insignificant; the few now retained have in general either an agreeable flavour to recommend them, or are capable of answering some useful purpose as medicine. Their common dole is the bulk of a nutmeg, or as much as can be taken up at once or twice upon the point of a knife. There is in general no great danger of exceeding in this particular.",
